OL,11,     Fthe West Coast.
OL,12,G2100 Tribe with Bruce Parry
OL,13,     FNew. The Waimaha: The explorer
OL,14,     Ftravels into the Colombian Amazon
OL,15,     Fto meet the Waimaha people, who
OL,16,     Flive successfully in this remote
OL,17,     Fregion thanks to their connection
OL,18,     Fto the rainforest.
